<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><div id=\"row-p_VEgB0HIe\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"row-align-center noBorder radius0 none c-row c-wrapper row-p_VEgB0HIe\"><!----><!----><div class=\"inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"col-eZ4jBjE1NF\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"borderFull radius10 none c-column c-wrapper col-eZ4jBjE1NF\"><!----><!----><div class=\"vertical inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr\" data-animation-class=\"\" style=\"\" class=\"c-custom-code c-wrapper faq-t0BB_OV2Hr\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"120\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><div id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr__custom-code\" class=\"custom-code-container cfaq-t0BB_OV2Hr\"><!-- FAQ accordion (same design as the blog FAQ). scripts/convert.mjs turns every GoHighLevel FAQ element into a\n     custom-code element carrying this markup, with that element's own questions and answers (<div class=\"snz-faq__item is-open\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a0\"><span>What financing options do you offer?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q0\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>We offer flexible financing through:</p><p></p><p>Synchrony Bank</p><p>Wells Fargo Bank, N.A.</p><p>Snap Finance (lease-to-own option)</p><p></p><p>This allows us to provide solutions for a wide range of credit profiles.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a1\"><span>Is financing available with 0% interest?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q1\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>We periodically offer promotional financing options, including:</p><p></p><p>No Interest If Paid in Full within a promotional period</p><p>Equal Monthly Payment plans</p><p></p><p>Important: For deferred interest promotions, if the balance is not paid in full within the promotional period, interest may be charged from the original purchase date. Minimum monthly payments are required. Subject to credit approval.</p><p></p><p>Ask in-store for current promotional details.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a2\"><span>What if I don’t qualify for traditional financing?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q2\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>We offer Snap Finance, a lease-to-own option.</p><p></p><p>Snap Finance is not a loan. It is a lease-to-own agreement designed for customers who may not qualify for traditional credit.</p><p></p><p>Fast application process</p><p>Flexible payment options</p><p>Early payoff options may be available</p><p></p><p>Total cost of ownership may exceed original purchase price if payments are made over the full term. </p><p></p><p>Approval is determined directly by Snap Finance.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a3\"><span>Does applying affect my credit?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q3\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Financing applications through Synchrony or Wells Fargo may involve a credit inquiry as determined by the lender.</p><p></p><p>Snap Finance uses its own approval criteria.</p><p></p><p>Approval decisions are made solely by the financing provider.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a4\"><span>How long does approval take?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q4\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>In most cases:</p><p></p><p>Applications are processed within minutes</p><p>Many customers receive a decision the same day</p><p></p><p>Approval timing depends on the financing provider and application details.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a5\"><span>Is there a minimum purchase required?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q5\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Some promotional financing offers require a minimum purchase amount.</p><p></p><p>Details vary by promotion and lender. Please see store for current requirements.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a6\"><span>Can I pay off my financing early?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a6\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q6\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Yes.</p><p></p><p>For traditional financing:</p><p>You may pay off your balance early without penalty (check lender terms). For Snap Finance:</p><p></p><p>Early purchase options may be available and can reduce total cost.</p><p></p><p>See financing provider for full terms.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q7\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a7\"><span>Who do I make payments to?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a7\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q7\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Payments are made directly to the financing provider:</p><p></p><p>Synchrony</p><p>Wells Fargo</p><p>Snap Finance</p><p></p><p>Snooze Mattress Company does not collect or service financing payments.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q8\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a8\"><span>Why finance instead of paying cash?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a8\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q8\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Financing allows you to:</p><p></p><p>✔ Upgrade your sleep now</p><p>✔ Protect your savings</p><p>✔ Spread payments over time</p><p>✔ Take advantage of promotional offers</p><p></p><p>Better sleep impacts your health, recovery, and daily performance — many customers prefer structured payments rather than delaying improvement.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a9\"><span>Is financing safe?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a9\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q9\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Yes.</p><p></p><p>We work with established financing providers who follow industry standards for consumer financing.</p><p></p><p>All financing approvals, terms, and servicing are handled directly by the lender or lease provider.</p><p></p><p>Snooze Mattress Company does not make credit decisions.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a10\"><span>How do I apply?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a10\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q10\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">You can:</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Apply in-store with a sleep specialist</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Start the process online (if enabled)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Ask about options during your visit</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Our team will walk you through the best option based on your needs.</span></p></div></div></div></div>).\n     One delegated click handler serves every copy (desktop + mobile) and survives hydration re-renders. -->\n<style>\n  /* the GoHighLevel FAQ container class kept a 2px border; the accordion draws its own */\n  .custom-code-container[class*=\"cfaq-\"] { border: 0 !important; padding: 0 !important; background: transparent !important; box-shadow: none !important; }\n  .snz-faq { display: grid; gap: 12px; width: 100%; --snz-faq-navy: #001489; --snz-faq-orange: #f58433; }\n  .snz-faq__item {\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 20, 137, 0.09);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -22px rgba(0, 20, 137, 0.35);\n    transition: border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;\n  }\n  .snz-faq__item:hover, .snz-faq__item.is-open { border-color: rgba(245, 132, 51, 0.45); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -24px rgba(0, 20, 137, 0.45); }\n  .snz-faq__q { margin: 0; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; }\n  .snz-faq__btn {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\n    width: 100%; padding: 18px 20px; border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; text-align: left;\n    font-family: var(--headlinefont, 'Montserrat', sans-serif); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--snz-faq-navy);\n    border-radius: 18px; -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;\n  }\n  .snz-faq__btn:hover { color: #d96f27; }\n  .snz-faq__btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--snz-faq-orange); outline-offset: -4px; }\n  .snz-faq__chevron { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 22px; height: 22px; color: var(--snz-faq-orange); transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1); }\n  .snz-faq__item.is-open .snz-faq__chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }\n  .snz-faq__panel { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 0fr; transition: grid-template-rows 0.34s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1); }\n  .snz-faq__item.is-open .snz-faq__panel { grid-template-rows: 1fr; }\n  .snz-faq__inner { min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }\n  .snz-faq__a { padding: 0 20px 20px; font-family: var(--contentfont, 'Montserrat', sans-serif); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #3f4460; }\n  .snz-faq__a p { margin: 0 0 0.6em; }\n  .snz-faq__a p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .snz-faq__a a { color: var(--snz-faq-navy); text-decoration: underline; }\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .snz-faq__btn { padding: 16px; font-size: 1rem; }\n    .snz-faq__a { padding: 0 16px 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .snz-faq__chevron, .snz-faq__panel, .snz-faq__item { transition: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"snz-faq\" data-snz-faq=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr\">\n<div class=\"snz-faq__item is-open\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a0\"><span>What financing options do you offer?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q0\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>We offer flexible financing through:</p><p></p><p>Synchrony Bank</p><p>Wells Fargo Bank, N.A.</p><p>Snap Finance (lease-to-own option)</p><p></p><p>This allows us to provide solutions for a wide range of credit profiles.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a1\"><span>Is financing available with 0% interest?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q1\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>We periodically offer promotional financing options, including:</p><p></p><p>No Interest If Paid in Full within a promotional period</p><p>Equal Monthly Payment plans</p><p></p><p>Important: For deferred interest promotions, if the balance is not paid in full within the promotional period, interest may be charged from the original purchase date. Minimum monthly payments are required. Subject to credit approval.</p><p></p><p>Ask in-store for current promotional details.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a2\"><span>What if I don’t qualify for traditional financing?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q2\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>We offer Snap Finance, a lease-to-own option.</p><p></p><p>Snap Finance is not a loan. It is a lease-to-own agreement designed for customers who may not qualify for traditional credit.</p><p></p><p>Fast application process</p><p>Flexible payment options</p><p>Early payoff options may be available</p><p></p><p>Total cost of ownership may exceed original purchase price if payments are made over the full term. </p><p></p><p>Approval is determined directly by Snap Finance.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a3\"><span>Does applying affect my credit?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q3\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Financing applications through Synchrony or Wells Fargo may involve a credit inquiry as determined by the lender.</p><p></p><p>Snap Finance uses its own approval criteria.</p><p></p><p>Approval decisions are made solely by the financing provider.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a4\"><span>How long does approval take?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q4\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>In most cases:</p><p></p><p>Applications are processed within minutes</p><p>Many customers receive a decision the same day</p><p></p><p>Approval timing depends on the financing provider and application details.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a5\"><span>Is there a minimum purchase required?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q5\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Some promotional financing offers require a minimum purchase amount.</p><p></p><p>Details vary by promotion and lender. Please see store for current requirements.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a6\"><span>Can I pay off my financing early?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a6\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q6\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Yes.</p><p></p><p>For traditional financing:</p><p>You may pay off your balance early without penalty (check lender terms). For Snap Finance:</p><p></p><p>Early purchase options may be available and can reduce total cost.</p><p></p><p>See financing provider for full terms.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q7\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a7\"><span>Who do I make payments to?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a7\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q7\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Payments are made directly to the financing provider:</p><p></p><p>Synchrony</p><p>Wells Fargo</p><p>Snap Finance</p><p></p><p>Snooze Mattress Company does not collect or service financing payments.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q8\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a8\"><span>Why finance instead of paying cash?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a8\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q8\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Financing allows you to:</p><p></p><p>✔ Upgrade your sleep now</p><p>✔ Protect your savings</p><p>✔ Spread payments over time</p><p>✔ Take advantage of promotional offers</p><p></p><p>Better sleep impacts your health, recovery, and daily performance — many customers prefer structured payments rather than delaying improvement.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a9\"><span>Is financing safe?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a9\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q9\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p>Yes.</p><p></p><p>We work with established financing providers who follow industry standards for consumer financing.</p><p></p><p>All financing approvals, terms, and servicing are handled directly by the lender or lease provider.</p><p></p><p>Snooze Mattress Company does not make credit decisions.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"snz-faq__item\"><h3 class=\"snz-faq__q\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"snz-faq__btn\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a10\"><span>How do I apply?</span><svg class=\"snz-faq__chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div class=\"snz-faq__panel\" id=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-a10\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-t0BB_OV2Hr-q10\"><div class=\"snz-faq__inner\"><div class=\"snz-faq__a\"><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">You can:</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Apply in-store with a sleep specialist</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Start the process online (if enabled)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Ask about options during your visit</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat\">Our team will walk you through the best option based on your needs.</span></p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!